title: TrueConf Server Compromised Client Installer
id: 622b7f29-c3b4-4b61-85d3-cefe8520d1c0
status: experimental
description: >
    Detects execution of a trojanized TrueConf client installer. Head Mare APT
    (Aug 2026) compromised TrueConf Server and replaced the Windows x64 client
    distribution with a backdoored installer containing the PhantomCore backdoor.
    Conference participants downloading the client from compromised servers receive
    the malicious version.
references:
    - https://cyberpress.org/trueconf-security-advisory-av26-835/
    - https://gbhackers.com/trueconf-vulnerabilities-cisa-kev/
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026/08/21
tags:
    - attack.t1204
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_installer:
        Image|endswith:
            - '\TrueConf-Setup.exe'
            - '\TrueConfServer-Client.exe'
        CommandLine|contains: '/D='
    selection_unsigned:
        Image|contains: 'TrueConf'
        Signed: 'false'
    condition: selection_installer or selection_unsigned
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate TrueConf client installations from trusted sources
    - TrueConf Server updating its own bundled client
level: high
